<title>ZIMBABWE: TABLE - SCHWEPPES RAISES YR SHR, DIV UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - SCHWEPPES RAISES YR SHR, DIV UP.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-yr to June 14, 1997</p>
<p>		(million Zimbabwe dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		     11.30	 vs     7.50</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		     3.00	  vs     1.90</p>
<p>    Pre-interest profit	 7.16	  vs     4.76</p>
<p>    Interest receivable	 0.05	  vs     -0.04</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		7.21	  vs     4.72</p>
<p>    Tax - current &amp; deferred  2.85	  vs     1.84</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	    4.36	  vs     2.88</p>
<p>    Turnover			68.41	 vs     47.10</p>
<p>Div payable August 29</p>
<p>on register August 8.</p>
<p>Full Name: Schweppes (Central Africa) Ltd.</p>
<p>Note:- The company said current trading conditions augured</p>
<p>well for steady demand for its brands in the second half of the</p>
<p>year -- traditionally the period when it derives the major part</p>
<p>of its revenues.</p>
<p>-- Harare Newsroom: 263-4 72 52 27/8/9</p>
</text>
